Z||000005||rockcrawl||01-26-2001||08:33 PM||||I've got a dual exh system from an 86 SE 4cyl that I bought from a salvage yard. The problem here is that they are required by state law to remove the catalytic converters, and they don't waste any time doing it. It looks like they used a giant shear and just pinched it right off at the bend. Destroyed a pefectly good system.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
